%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
I was guiding the still-staggering Asami back to her new\napartment.%K%P
我依然抱着有些不稳的麻实的腰，\n被她带着，朝着她的新公寓走去。%K%P
The silence continued for a while, as neither of us had\nanything to say. Before long, however, Asami spoke up...\nand nearly gave me a heart attack.%K%P
不知过了多久，麻实扔下来一颗重磅炸弹，\n中断了我们长长的对话。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dLike I said, the results of the year-end examinations are\nalready out.\nI told you they'd be announced right after winter break.\d%K%P
「就是那个，年末统一模拟考试的结果。已经出了的。\n之前不也说过暑假结束的时候就会出」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait a second, Asami...\nYou just told me you haven't checked them.\d%K%P
「等会，等等，麻实…\n你刚才不是说你还不知道结果么」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI was lying -- I mean, there's no way a teacher\nresponsible for third year students could be that laid-\nback.\d%K%P
「那是在骗你。\n这段时间，三年级学生的班主任怎么可能那么淡定」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou lied...?\d%K%P
「骗我…这」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dShe got 280 points across five subjects, ranking 202th in\nthe entire school and 25th in her class. She managed to\nget 80 for Japanese, but only 16 for Math... which I\nteach.\d%K%P
「５门总分２８０分。\n年级第２０２名，班级第２５名。\n国语好歹还有８０分…我教的数学…１６分」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWha...\d%K%P
「什…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThe chance of her getting into her first choice, Shuusen\nPreparatory, is about twenty percent. Provided, of course,\nthat she was taking regular examinations. I'm not even\ntalking about her scholarship.\d%K%P
「第一志愿的秋泉大附，通过可能性是２０％。\n当然这是对普通考试而言，如果是免费生考试的话…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...That's also a lie, right?\d%K%P
「…这也是骗我的吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI suspected it might've been a mistake on the part of the\ncompany that handled the grading. Or that she either\nforgot to write her name or was accidentally filling out\nthe wrong answer column.\d%K%P
「是改卷的老师算错分数了么，\n是她忘记写名字了么，\n还是说答串行了么」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sure it's the company's fault.\nToko would never make such a basic mistake.\d%K%P
「那肯定是老师算错了。\n都子不会犯这么蠢的错误…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYeah, she said the same thing.\n...And she seemed to accept those scores.\d%K%P
「是啊，本人也这么说。\n…而且，似乎对这个分数还表示可以接受」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo way...\d%K%P
「怎么这样…」%K%P
How much of this could have been true?%K%P
到底哪些是真的，哪些是假的。%K%P
That beer must've gotten to me... I felt a headache coming\non, paired up with some nausea.%K%P
这时候，肚子里还剩一半的啤酒翻滚起来…\n头一跳一跳地痛，感觉整个胃袋都被攥紧了。%K%P
As that peculiar mood of elation and security began to\nwane, I found myself having trouble breathing.%K%P
刚才还萦绕在身边的，\n混杂着安心感和高扬情绪的空气瞬间变得稀薄，\n让我有些窒息。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's okay... I told her these results won't affect the\nactual examinations. I mean, she has them next week.\d%K%P
「没关系…\n她自己也说，这个结果对免费生考试不会有影响。\n毕竟正式考试在下个星期」%K%P
That was right... Toko would face one of the biggest\nchallenges of her life next week.%K%P
对啊…\n将对都子一生产生影响的决胜局，还在下个星期…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy...?\d%K%P
「为什么…」%K%P
Himeo and I, and Toko herself, of course -- we all did our\nbest to prepare for the big day.%K%P
我、姬绪小姐、当然还有都子，\n在考试策略上不可能有疏忽的啊。%K%P
So what on earth happened?%K%P
到底，出现了什么问题？%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI doubt it has anything to do with her preparations --\nshe's just in a slump right now. Surely you can get her to\nsnap out of it if you have some kind of impetus in\nmind...\d%K%P
「我觉得并不是因为准备不足。\n只是学习的低谷期吧。\n有什么转机的话，马上就跟原来一样了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dImpetus, huh...?\d%K%P
「转机…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I suppose I had pissed her off more times than I could\nkeep track of up until now.%K%P
至今为止，好多次惹恼她，\n好多次给她添麻烦。%K%P
But her grades, which were in a steady decline ever since\nMs. Honoka's disappearance, began to improve when I came\nhere.%K%P
即便如此，在穗香小姐不在的时候变差的成绩，\n也在我来了之后，稳步提升。%K%P
I wasn't expecting her grades to keep rising with\nbasically no limit, like a graph detailing a period of\nhigh economic growth.%K%P
就像是经济快速发展期一样，\n以为都子的成绩会一直这样上升，\n我确实抱着这样的幻想…%K%P
But there was no way bubble economics could apply to\nsomething like this. It didn't make sense.%K%P
可是就是因为有这样的想法，当经济泡沫破裂，\n情况急转直下时，会觉得这些不是现实。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami... What should I do?\nIs there anything I can do to make her snap out of it?\d%K%P
「呐，麻实。\n我要怎么做才好？\n怎么样做，才能给都子带来转机？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're asking me...?\d%K%P
「这你要来问我么…？」%K%P
Despite the fact I was embracing her moments before --\nindulging myself in her kindness -- I was now treating her\nterribly. I knew that, but...%K%P
刚才还紧紧抱住的、\n刚才还是我不停撒娇对象的她，\n意想不到地转换成为冷酷的态度。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI mean... you're her homeroom teacher, right?\nIt should be part of your job to hear her out, at least!\d%K%P
「因为…麻实是都子的班主任把？\n那孩子的烦恼，得好好跟她商量不是么」%K%P
I felt a misdirected anger broil within me, aimed at the\nvery person who gave me that prior sense of security.%K%P
她对于稍稍给予其安心的对象，\n突然收回了给予出去的安心，\n产生了莫名其妙的愤怒。%K%P
It might have come off as extremely unfair towards Asami,\nbut this was one thing I couldn't possibly back down from.%K%P
麻实这么想不开，我也能理解。\n我无力辩解…但是，无法去改变。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I thought it was the responsibility of a guardian to\nlook after the mental well-being of their children.\d%K%P
「…你作为监护人，\n也有照顾她的义务吧？」%K%P
Asami's words took on an accusatory tone as well.%K%P
所以麻实的话语里，\n也有我完全无法理解的东西。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOr rather, it's a problem that pertains to her private\nlife, so you should be the one doing something about it.\d%K%P
「不对，涉及到私人问题的时候，\n你才是应当负担起主要责任」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHer private life...?\nIs it really a problem I can help with...?\d%K%P
「私人问题…？\n是我能想办法处理的问题吗？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'd say you're our prime candidate for it. Although it's\nprobably not what you think it is.\d%K%P
「有点不对…\n是只有你，才能担起的责任」%K%P
It didn't seem like she was merely abandoning her\nresponsibilities as a teacher.%K%P
看来她并不是放弃了作为班主任的义务。%K%P
Her face reflected only frustrated resignation -- she\ngenuinely believed herself to be powerless in solving this\nissue.%K%P
从她懊悔的表情能看出来，\n她大概是觉得自己真的什么也做不了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat should I do?\nWhat should I do, Asami?\d%K%P
「怎么做才好？\n麻实，我要怎么做才好？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm sorry, Osamu, but I think it's about time you stopped\nrunning to me from all your problems.\d%K%P
「对不起，理…\n你也差不多不要向我这里逃避了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dGh?!\d%K%P
「！？」%K%P
My forehead broke out in cold sweat as I felt myself\novercome by an inexplicable sensation of guilt.%K%P
不知从何而来的罪恶感，\n在麻实的言语刺激下，混着冷汗一起迸发出来。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I guess that's not exactly it. Look, as long as you\nkeep running to me, her issue won't ever be solved.\d%K%P
「…不是。\n你只要还继续逃到我这里，\n就没有办法解决那孩子的烦恼」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't get it...\nHow are the two of us related to this issue at all?\d%K%P
「你在说什么我不懂啊…\n为什么不能依靠麻实？」%K%P
Even as the wintry breeze chilled my skin, my voice\ncontinued to tremble while fat beads of sweat rolled down\nmy forehead.%K%P
一月的寒风吹过夜晚的街道，\n冷汗浮上我的额头，声音也不禁颤抖起来。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou should try asking Mitoko directly.\d%K%P
「你直接去问美都子吧…」%K%P
Asami regarded me with pity in her eyes, yet it didn't\nseem like she planned to change her suddenly cold and\ndistant attitude.%K%P
对这样变化的我，麻实用着可怜的眼神凝视着我，\n可是这撒手不管的态度，并不像是有所松动。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI think she'll be able to tell you everything... from\nwhat's worrying her, to how you can solve it.\d%K%P
「事到如今，她会好好告诉你的。\n她在烦恼什么，要怎么样才能解决」%K%P
Asami's words urged me to go, yet her eyes looked as\nthough they were pleading for me to stay.%K%P
嘴里一边说着鼓动我的话，\n一边却露出了像是在阻止我的眼神。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...It's something you've never even considered. Or should\nI say... something you tried your best to ignore.\d%K%P
「…会给你一个你想象不到的答案，\n不，是你绝对不会想到的答案」%K%P
.........%K%P
………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI see... so Ms. Kouno told you.\d%K%P
「这样啊…\n老师已经跟理君说过了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
The next day, during my designated tutoring hour...%K%P
第二天…\n轮到我做家庭教师的日子。%K%P
Toko made a weak smile.%K%P
当我说到这个问题时，都子露出了无力的微笑。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI see... so she was meeting with you again.\d%K%P
「这样…\n老师又和理君见面了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... I was the one who contacted her, actually.\d%K%P
「那、那个…\n是我主动联系想要见她的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo, it's okay... It feels like I was left behind again,\nbut I guess it's too late to regret it.\d%K%P
「不，没什么…\n似乎又是她把你甩开的吧…\n不过到现在才后悔也已经晚了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...?\d%K%P
「都子…？」%K%P
Toko folded her arms above the kotatsu table and cast her\ngaze downwards, once again preventing me from reading her\nexpression.%K%P
在被炉上两手叠在一起，低着头。\n她又露出我读不懂的表情了…%K%P
I... had no idea what she was trying to say.%K%P
都子，嘟囔着什么，我却完全明白不了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's right. I messed up my grades a little.\d%K%P
「没错。\n成绩稍微下滑了一些」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA little...?\d%K%P
「不是稍微吧…」%K%P
Her average score of 90 from two months ago had suddenly\nfallen below 60, causing her to plummet from the top and\nplacing her way behind the rest of the class.%K%P
两个月前平均分还有９０多分，\n突然就跌落至６０分以下了？\n班上过半的同学都过了６０分吧？%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry, Osamu. I was lying back then.\d%K%P
「抱歉啊理君。前段时间我撒谎了」%K%P
\dR-Right... They went well. Same as usual.\d%K%P
『啊、啊啊………挺顺利的』%K%P
Now that I thought about it... she wasn't looking into my\neyes back then, was she?%K%P
这么说起来…\n那个时候也是，都子并没有直视我的眼睛。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou did everything in your power to help with my studies,\nbut getting into Shuusen Preparatory might be too much for\nme, after all. I'm... really sorry about all this.\d%K%P
「之前这么费心照顾我学习…\n秋泉大附，大概考不上了…真是对不起」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou don't need to apologize.\nI just want to know why... How did this happen?\d%K%P
「没有向我道歉的必要。\n只是，那个…为什么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou were the very best in your class at the end of the\nsecond term, right? Your Math grades were getting better,\ntoo.\d%K%P
「第二学期期末的时候不是班上第一名么？\n数学成绩不也是一直往上升么」%K%P
Asami put extra effort into teaching her that subject,\nespecially after feeling indebted to her from the month\nshe spent living here.%K%P
麻实也是，作为对都子的回报，\n尽其所能地辅导都子的数学。%K%P
As a result, she got 92 points on her final test. It was\napparently the first time in her life she ever exceeded 90\nfor Math. We pretty much danced from joy that day.%K%P
多亏如此，最后期末得了９２分。\n因为不擅长数学，这是第一次超过９０分。\n我们还拉着手很高兴来着…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhaha... I was pretty good at holding it in back then.\d%K%P
「哈哈…我也真是能忍呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHolding... what in?\d%K%P
「忍…什么意思」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEven then... I was getting worked up and everything, but\nI could still lose myself in studying. In retrospect, I\nwas doing pretty well back then, able to think about other\nthings...\d%K%P
「那个时候啊，怎么说呢，\n学习的时候，很多东西就被忘记了。\n心里还需要再祛除一点杂念才行」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
Why was she making such a sad smile...?%K%P
怎么回事，这么落寞的笑容…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI actually still thought I could do something about my\nfeelings on my own.\d%K%P
「我的感情，\n就像我所想的那样被玩弄着，\n我就这样轻松考虑着啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs it anxiety? Are you nervous about the exams?\d%K%P
「不安？\n因为考试的事精神紧张？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's a little... different.\d%K%P
「有那么一点不对」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat do you mean, different?\d%K%P
「不对，是什么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThe exams just happened to come up at the worst time. If\nI do everything the way I used to, I'm pretty sure I can\npass them.\d%K%P
「考试只是赶上了一个不好的时候。\n按照我的水平，正常发挥就没关系了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen... what about the exams and the interview next week?\nDo you think you'll be able solve this issue by then?\d%K%P
「那…下个星期的考试和面试呢？\n那个时候能振作起来么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
Fidgeting, she folded her arms again and looked up into my\neyes, seemingly eager to say something.%K%P
都子很扭捏地揉搓着双手，\n像是要想说什么，仰头望着我。%K%P
Her normally firm refusal to rely on others... was nowhere\nto be seen in her gaze now.%K%P
那个表情，和我所熟知的决心\n以及『万事不求人』的表情完全不同。%K%P
This was the face of someone wanting to share all her\nworries and insecurities with another. She wanted someone\nto relieve her of her burden.%K%P
像是要把自己的烦恼，不安全都倾诉出来，\n期待谁能给予解决的样子…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat do you want me to do...?\d%K%P
「我要怎么做才好…？」%K%P
More specifically... that certain someone was the man\ntalking to her now.%K%P
至于具体要向谁倾诉…\n只能是眼前这个交谈着的我。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
Displaying little to no hesitation, she took the hand I\nextended towards her with both of hers...%K%P
所以，我没有一点犹豫，\n握住了她的双手。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWill you go out of your way to help me again?\nWill you try to grant me the happiness I want?\d%K%P
「还在为了我而勉强么？\n还会实现我所追求的幸福么？」%K%P
...and held it so tightly that her nails dug into my\nflesh.%K%P
指甲都快掐到肉里了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI've said this before. If it's something within my\npower...\d%K%P
「之前大概说过了…\n只要是我能做到的事情…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt is, Osamu.\nAll you have to do is put up with something for a little.\d%K%P
「理君肯定能做到的…\n真的，只要稍微忍耐一下就好…」%K%P
She pulled my hand closer to her chest, exhaling a\nmouthful of air at it.%K%P
都子用双手抓住我的右手，拉到胸前，\n把嘴凑在上面，轻轻地吐气。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
By the time I sensed that almost burning sensation at my\nskin, it was too late for me to escape her hold.%K%P
当我意识到那份着火一样的热气时，\n我已经无法从都子的束缚里逃脱了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHug... me...\d%K%P
「抱我………」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dT... Toko...\d%K%P
「都…都子…」%K%P
I reflexively pulled my hand back, distancing myself from\nthe kotatsu table.%K%P
我反射性地抖开都子的双手，\n从被炉里跳了起来。%K%P
The tea spilling out of the cup I knocked over seeped into\nthe kotatsu's fabric, but I was in no state to look for a\nrag.%K%P
从翻到的茶杯里流出来的茶水，\n浸湿了被炉的棉被，\n我却没有拿毛巾来处理的闲暇。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat's wrong, Osamu...?\nYou didn't have a problem with it on the night of the\ntyphoon.\d%K%P
「怎么了理君…？\n刮台风那天…不也抱了我的么」%K%P
Toko seemed like she had predicted my reaction. She fixed\nher gaze on me, her eyes betraying no hint of shock.%K%P
都子像是预测到了我的态度，\n一点也不惊讶，\n但是…终于与我四目相对。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhen I was scared and all alone in your room, crying in\nthe dark... you held me in your arms until morning came.\d%K%P
「害怕、痛苦、寂寞的我，\n在理君的房间里哭泣，\n就这样被一直抱着直到天亮不是么…」%K%P
Toko no longer averted her gaze from mine, and her meek\nattitude vanished like it was never there to begin with --\ninstead, she now looked at me with eyes brimming with\ndetermination.%K%P
一改之前我捉摸不定的弱气表情，\n都子换上强硬的意志，用深色的眼瞳紧紧盯着我。%K%P
