In my sheer confusion, I almost started babbling.\nMeanwhile, I kept taking steps backwards to put some more\ndistance between myself and Toko.%K%P
陷于混乱的我已经顾不上前言后语的联系了，\n只是一味后退，与都子保持距离。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAre you really this dense?\d%K%P
「这样的事情都不知道么？」%K%P
