Instead, the very notion appeared to light a fire in me,\nmaking me even more uncertain, scared... and somewhat\nexpectant.%K%P
岂止是不讨厌…与之相反的感情直向上奔涌沸腾，\n诱导着…我激烈的不安、恐惧和期待。%K%P
