往上看着的眼瞳，直直的…真的是，直直的。%K%P
Desperate to close the distance, she pressed her hands\nagainst my shoulders, trying to rise as high as her\ntiptoes would allow.%K%P
像是要拼命拉近因为身高带来的距离一样，\n都子抓住我的肩膀，使劲抬着脚尖。%K%P
